      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stepping away\" ... i feel like i already tried that. i took time off, i tried to slow down, but the debt doesn't stop and the people i let down don't just forget. it's not like there's a pause button on life. i just feel like no matter what i do, the pressure is always gonna be there waiting for me the second i look up. it feels so permanent. like there's no version of the future where this actually gets better.",
