      "content": "\"giving up\" sounds like something i'm already doing, just in slow motion. it's like i'm just waiting for the crash. i look at my bank account or my emails and i just think... what's the point of even struggling through another day if this is just how it's gonna be forever? it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise is something much more certain than just 'letting go' of a few tasks. something that actually ends the cycle.",
